---
/** The home until a page with the address "home" is published: in Materialize's own look. */
---

<main class="welcome">
  <div class="card">
    <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 72 72" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect width="72" height="72" rx="17" fill="#5B4BEA"></rect>
      <g transform="translate(14 14) scale(0.6875)" fill="#fff">
        <rect x="2" y="2" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.3"></rect>
        <rect x="2" y="14.5" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.3"></rect>
        <rect x="2" y="27" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.3"></rect>
        <rect x="2" y="39.5" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.3"></rect>
        <rect x="2" y="52" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.3"></rect>
        <rect x="14.5" y="14.5" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.5"></rect>
        <rect x="27" y="27" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.7"></rect>
        <rect x="39.5" y="14.5" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6" opacity="0.85"></rect>
        <rect x="52" y="2" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6"></rect>
        <rect x="52" y="14.5" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6"></rect>
        <rect x="52" y="27" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6"></rect>
        <rect x="52" y="39.5" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6"></rect>
        <rect x="52" y="52" width="10" height="10" rx="2.6"></rect>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <h1>Qui nascerà il sito.</h1>
    <p>
      Entra nel pannello e crea una pagina con indirizzo <code>home</code>: appena la pubblichi, comparirà
      qui.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/admin/">Apri il pannello</a>
    <p class="note">
      Prima volta? Il pannello chiede il link di installazione che il server ha scritto all’avvio: con Docker lo
      mostra <code>docker compose logs materialize</code>.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
  .welcome {
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 40% at 50% 0%, rgb(91 75 234 / 0.18), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 18px 18px,
      #0b0b0e;
    color: #ededf0;
    font-family: 'Geist Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #141418;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.45);
  }
  .mark {
    display: block;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgb(237 237 240 / 0.72);
  }
  code {
    font: 500 0.9em 'Geist Mono Variable', ui-monospace, monospace;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    color: #ededf0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .button {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #6d5ff5;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .button:hover {
    background: #7b6ef7;
  }
  .note {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgb(237 237 240 / 0.55);
  }
  .note code {
    white-space: normal;
  }
</style>
